      "value": "Hi @{60189fe37ae30b2338042f44|full_name}! Thanks for the report.\n\nThis is probably related to `eventSystem.pixelDragThreshold` not being exposed in the worlds SDK. (And ClientSim not replicating VRChat's behaviour correctly).\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2019.1/Documentation/Manual/script-EventSystem.html",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
