      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} Thanks for the reply. I did suspect it was related to that; it appears that even if we put an Event System component in the world with a configured value, it's disabled/overridden by VRChat's own settings for it.\n\nI did try several orders of magnitude for canvas scale / pixel amount and it appears that the drag threshold isn't affected by the number of pixels in the canvas but rather the real-world size of it.",
